  "description": {
   "en": "After rampant bullying, high school boy Takeshi Hirota kills himself and is transported to another another world, where he is accepted by the orcs due to his appearance.\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [MangaHot Web](https://web.mangahot.jp/works/detail.php?work_code=z_R0185)\n**Alt Official English:** [Comikey](https://comikey.com/comics/revenge-of-the-pig-manga/803/)",
   "ja": "男はずっと、ずっと、ずっといじめられ続けてきた。いじめられ続けた理由はただ一つ「顔が豚に似ているから」。日々過酷さを増す絶望の中、偶然転移した異世界で掴んだ小さな幸せ。しかし、その幸せは同じく転移してきた同級生達に無残に踏みにじられる……。舞台は異世界ーー。"
  },
